      "message": "So in some sense these types of queries should stay private since no user should need to ever actually query anything about the current refs (assuming we\u0027ve setup the system correctly). However, I do see the value in the assert that uses this, because if we did mess up it would be a very frustrating bug to debug without such an assert.\n\nMaybe instead we add a debug only query in `protected` that just calls into the private one. That way no one could accidentally try to use the call for making a real decision.",
